      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787990735762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - Send notification to user preferred channels\n    - user can receive notifi's\n    - support multiple channels: Email, SMS, Push, slack\n    - User can have multiple channels\n\n2. Entities:\n    - NotificationService: manages to send notifications to users\n    - Channels: EmailChannel, SMSChannel, PushChannel\n    - Notification: content, timestamp\n    - User: id, name, email, phone, user_preferences\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Clarify Requirements:\n    - Send notification to user preferred channels\n    - user can receive notifi's\n    - support multiple channels: Email, SMS, Push, slack\n    - User can have multiple channels\n\n2. Entities:\n    - NotificationService: manages to send notifications to users\n    - Channels: EmailChannel, SMSChannel, PushChannel\n    - Notification: content, timestamp\n    - User: id, name, email, phone, user_preferences\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
